### 🟩 Issue 6: `contextualSuggestions` Returns Max 3 Results — May Suppress High-Value Suggestions

**File:** [`contextualSuggestions.ts:127`](file:///d:/spreadsheet/smartsht/src/ai/contextualSuggestions.ts#L127)

```typescript
if (!seen.has(s.text) && results.length < 3) {
```

**Problem:** Goal-based suggestions (priority 10) always win the top slots. If `listSuggestedGoals` returns 3 goals, the data-aware suggestions (outlier warnings, budget overspend, etc.) are completely suppressed even when they're more relevant.

**Fix:** Consider a smarter mix: max 2 goal chips + 1 insight chip, or cap goal chips at 2:

```typescript
const goalCount = suggestions.filter((s) => s.priority === 10).length
const cap = goalCount >= 2 ? 1 : 3 - goalCount  // reserve at least 1 slot for insights
```

